@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Resolve a rider level
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
participant "Caller (handler)" as caller
box "Backend — Telo.Ride.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "LevelTable" as levels
end box
caller -> levels : Progress(totalXp)
levels -> levels : Highest level whose threshold totalXp reaches, 1 to 30 (L2-038 AC1)
alt Level < 30
  levels --> caller : Level, next threshold, XP to next ("760 XP to level 8" at 1840, AC4)
else Level = 30
  levels --> caller : Level 30, next threshold none; total keeps growing (AC2)
end
note over levels
Known thresholds: level 2 = 400 XP, level 8 = 2,600, level 19 = 10,400.
All other thresholds: <TO SUPPLY> (L2.md open question 1).
end note
@enduml
